# Apache Hardening & Security Configuration
# Place this in Apache DocumentRoot or reverse-proxy directory

# 1. Disable server signature and version banner
ServerSignature Off

# 2. Suppress Server response headers exposing Apache/OS/OpenSSL versions
<IfModule mod_headers.c>
    Header unset Server
    Header always unset Server
    Header unset X-Powered-By
    Header always unset X-Powered-By
</IfModule>
